{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>郭柏妍（Rosita）是2020年香港小姐競選季軍，憑藉甜美清純的外貌與親和力，深受網民喜愛。早前她在《夫妻的博弈》中飾演綠茶Sherman，亮眼演出備受觀眾認可！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2d02e073-226d-436f-8162-cb886c0b393c.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026kfcnWN01gk1789526593.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2d02e073-226d-436f-8162-cb886c0b393c.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_f11fa6c318c1ad6d-402\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>向來痛錫粉絲的Rosita，日前在社交平台上載了一輯早前出席《2026香港小姐競選》紅地氈的靚相，養眼指數爆燈，惹來網民狂Like！從相中所見，Rosita以一身閃鑽露肩晚裝優雅亮相，貴氣十足。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_f11fa6c318c1ad6d-402\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"bf7abafc-be02-402b-a30f-de10c23cb2c0.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026XXZmCKCxl91789526593.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"bf7abafc-be02-402b-a30f-de10c23cb2c0.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_f11fa6c318c1ad6d-402\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_f11fa6c318c1ad6d-403\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>靚相曝光後，吸引大批網民紛紛湧入留言區，大讚她：「美若天仙！」及「好靚呀～好優雅嘅感覺」。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T03:20:25.821536+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}